# CVEs accepted for the svg-render image, one per line, with a reason and a date.
# The gate is CRITICAL + HIGH with --ignore-unfixed, so anything landing here is
# a fixed vulnerability we are choosing to carry — say why, and revisit it.
#
# Example:
# CVE-2024-0000  # only reachable through the CLI, image never runs it — 2026-08-13
